      "key": "Round trip between a player and the relay. Before a match (quick match, start checklist) it is a probe of the region, an estimate.",
      "size": 13,
      "scale": 2,
      "text": "सामन्यापूर्वी (झटपट सामना, सुरुवातीची तपासणी यादी) हा त्या प्रदेशाशी जोडणी",
